    "html": "<ls-h style=\"display:contents!important\" lang=\"en\"><ls-b style=\"display:contents!important\"><section class=\"section\" data-lumen-slot=\"visible\"><div class=\"padding-global padding-section-medium btm-5\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"grid gap-4rem center\"><div class=\"layout_img-container\"><img src=\"/brands/garner/assets/183c54b76eafd12319b991d4a9fe1ab918fdcb48fcc90931a527d96058ef9308.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"568\" height=\"543\" alt=\"Map of the United States showing state boundaries with numerous white dots scattered across each state representing specific locations.\" srcset=\"/brands/garner/assets/97c3cc95733862682ab136de29119aad53684a9522f7185bfca2f8606c578f74.avif 500w, /brands/garner/assets/535ed1f88b3c0c5c3f5ab7ad2d74d3631fd99ef293b9b31860d4a657eddf6407.avif 800w, /brands/garner/assets/183c54b76eafd12319b991d4a9fe1ab918fdcb48fcc90931a527d96058ef9308.avif 1136w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 568px\" class=\"layout_img\" data-lumen-slot=\"image\"></div><div class=\"max-width-medium align-center\"><div data-animation=\"slide-up\" class=\"text-align-center\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><h2 data-lumen-slot=\"headline\">More data and new analytics to evaluate providers<br></h2><div class=\"spacer rg\"></div><p class=\"text-size-medium is-grey\" data-lumen-slot=\"body\">We\u2019ve compiled the largest claims database in the U.S.\u2014over 60 billion medical records from 320 million patients\u2014to identify which doctors diagnose more accurately and have better patient outcomes.<br></p><div class=\"spacer m\"></div><div class=\"flex is-center\"><button data-wf--button--variant=\"secondary\" class=\"button w-variant-09e8974d-7a2b-56d4-54dd-ccfba1b9eec9\"><div>See how it works</div><a aria-label=\"{{wf {&quot;propId&quot;:&quot;fc0003a1-20ca-e1d5-3f31-6f172ac626e4&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PlainText&quot;} }}\" href=\"/how-it-works\" class=\"butt